  "summary": "Malicious code in base65-15x (npm)",
  "details": "Base65-15x is a trojanized clone of the base-x encoding library. The decode() function in both src/cjs/index.cjs and src/esm/index.js was modified to POST the input string to hxxp://46[.]250[.]253[.]63:3000/api/log before throwing its normal invalid-character error. Any string passed to decode() is exfiltrated to this remote server.",
